And this really sort of falls into three buckets.

92
00:11:45,264 --> 00:11:57,824
首先，就是尽可能快地成功测量当前的晶圆，以保持生产尽可能快地运行。
firstly, there's just trying to successfully measure the um the current
wafer as quickly as possible to keep production running as fast as we can.

