00:11:58,544 --> 00:12:08,356
如果失败了，我们仍会尝试看看，好，有没有足够的测量数据让我们能继续处理这片晶圆？
And if that fails, then we still try and see, okay, is there a way of
getting enough measurement that we can still continue with this wafer?

