如果我们真的无法处理当前的晶圆，你知道，如果它出了严重问题，那么，呃，你知道，
我们能不能快速把它从系统中清除，把下一片晶圆送入系统，然后继续生产？
if we really cannot expose the current wafer, you know, if there's something critically wrong with it, then, uh, you know,
can we quickly clear it out of our system, get the next wafer into the system, and carry on production?

97
00:12:37,998 --> 00:12:45,956
最后，我们的第三个驱动力是，你知道，我们开始增加新功能，增加新的建模方式。
And then finally, our third drive of this was you know we started adding new features, new ways of doing modeling.

