要么我们让这些人不高兴，在这种情况下，我们是在说「嗯，你必须更改你的工作自动化系统」，
或者我们通过选择折中方案让每个人都高兴，或者
or we make these guys unhappy, in which case, we're saying, "Well, you have to change your working automation system,
Or you make everyone happy by picking something in the middle, or we absorb the complexity ourselves, in which case we're unhappy.

