00:36:51,648 --> 00:36:56,420
而在这个 bug 引入的那一刻，它就是一个 bug。
And at the point when this bug was introduced, it was a bug.

270
00:36:58,862 --> 00:37:10,116
它没被视为特别高的优先级，因为外推数据和实测数据之间的差异极其微小。
It wasn't seen as particularly high priority because the difference
between that extrapolation and the measured data was absolutely tiny.

271
00:37:10,608 --> 00:37:15,008
所以，你知道，我们当时还有更紧急的事情要处理。
So, you know, we we had some more urgent things to deal with.

