00:37:43,648 --> 00:37:54,276
然后他们基本上就回来跟我们说，嗯，你知道的，是的，我们正依赖你们不测量晶圆的这部分。
And then basically they come back and they say, well, um, you know, yes, we're relying on you not measuring this part of the wafer.

